===Etymology===
From {{MF.}} intensive prefix re- and ''[[sentir]]'', from Latin ''[[sentire]]''.

===Noun===
'''resentment'''
# a [[feeling]] of [[anger]], [[indignation]] or [[extreme]] [[displeasure]], especially one that results from a [[grievance]], [[insult]] or [[slight]]

